36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:38,280
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">Tactician Komei's Speculation</font></font>

38
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:54,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this really Moso's house?</font>

39
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here he's a superintendent officer,</font>

40
00:01:57,630 --> 00:02:00,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I thought it'd be a more luxurious
building with gold folding screens.</font>

41
00:02:01,550 --> 00:02:03,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your voices are too loud.</font>

42
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:09,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Moso is a magnificent person
with no self-interests.</font>

43
00:02:09,690 --> 00:02:12,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he lives frugally.</font>

44
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you know, he's an old man</font>

45
00:02:14,780 --> 00:02:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who's the second most important guy in
the land next to the feudal lord, right?</font>

46
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:20,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He smacks of being really poor.</font>

47
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

48
00:02:29,210 --> 00:02:33,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well well, how shameful of me
to present such a poor residence.</font>

49
00:02:34,380 --> 00:02:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Moso.</font>

50
00:02:38,010 --> 00:02:38,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

51
00:02:39,930 --> 00:02:43,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This old man like from
some dumpling shop?</font>

52
00:02:45,890 --> 00:02:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm an old man from
a dumpling shop?</font>

53
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Jeez, unbelievable!
— Idiot!</font>

54
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing, Neji?!</font>

55
00:02:55,860 --> 00:02:58,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, make yourselves comfortable.</font>

56
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:03,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you are ninja who came from
the Village Hidden in Leaves?</font>

57
00:03:03,570 --> 00:03:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the right,
this is Naruto, Neji and Tenten.</font>

58
00:03:09,790 --> 00:03:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear you encountered
the Cursed Warrior that appeared</font>

59
00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:15,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in Lord Komei's residence last night.</font>

60
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

61
00:03:17,510 --> 00:03:19,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, how did it go?</font>

62
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:22,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you figure out the true identity
of the Cursed Warrior?</font>

63
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:25,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, it's a real ghost.</font>

64
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, a ghost, huh?</font>

65
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be jumping to conclusions
on your own.</font>

66
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he appears all of a sudden
and flies around.</font>

67
00:03:34,610 --> 00:03:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, and on top of that,
the inside of his armor was empty.</font>

68
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:41,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how bizarre the thing,
there's always a trick.</font>

69
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll pin down the true identity
without fail.</font>

70
00:03:45,450 --> 00:03:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is encouraging...</font>

71
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:52,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have just changed feudal lords
and the public is still anxious.</font>

72
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:57,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please eliminate the rumors of
the Cursed Warrior as soon as possible.</font>

73
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I beg of you.</font>

74
00:04:01,510 --> 00:04:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please!</font>

75
00:04:06,890 --> 00:04:08,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Tsurucho Yakitori"</b></font>

76
00:04:08,810 --> 00:04:10,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here are your chicken wings.</font>

77
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, here we go!</font>

78
00:04:12,310 --> 00:04:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They look tasty!</font>

79
00:04:15,650 --> 00:04:16,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hot!</font>

80
00:04:18,230 --> 00:04:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Moso superintendent officer
seems like a good guy.</font>

81
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. It was also Lord Moso
who came to my rescue</font>

82
00:04:24,110 --> 00:04:27,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and selected me to be a page.</font>

83
00:04:27,660 --> 00:04:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The son of the feudal lord succeeds him</font>

84
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:32,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and an excellent superintendent officer
offers him tutelage...</font>

85
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:36,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The government appears
to be stable, but...</font>

86
00:04:36,170 --> 00:04:39,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why is there a strange rumor
going around</font>

87
00:04:39,210 --> 00:04:41,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about the haunting
of the previous feudal lord?</font>

88
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's probably somebody displeased</font>

89
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with this dramatic replacement
of the feudal lord.</font>

90
00:04:49,890 --> 00:04:52,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have any idea who it might be?</font>

91
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:56,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it might be Lord Komei, after all.</font>

92
00:04:56,850 --> 00:04:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that the name of
the tactician you were talking about</font>

93
00:04:58,980 --> 00:05:01,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who wanted to become the feudal lord?</font>

94
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:05,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why did the Cursed Warrior
appear in his residence?</font>

95
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps to deflect attention.</font>

96
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:12,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it. I bet that's it.</font>

97
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, since it's come to this,</font>

98
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:17,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we can nab that old man
called Komei or whatever</font>

99
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and quickly get him to own up...</font>

100
00:05:20,380 --> 00:05:22,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guys, let's get fired up and
get going!</font>

101
00:05:23,210 --> 00:05:26,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot. We can't do something
like that without proof.</font>

102
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:29,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is a tactician of this land
more or less, so...</font>

103
00:05:30,010 --> 00:05:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh man, that's no fun.</font>

104
00:05:34,770 --> 00:05:37,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, I want to meet Lord Sagi,
the feudal lord.</font>

105
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:41,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not possible. Lord Sagi
does not like to meet anybody.</font>

106
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:45,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be such a stick-in-the-mud.
Let us meet him, okay?</font>

107
00:05:46,030 --> 00:05:48,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a "nipple" friend, right?</font>

108
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:51,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're going to say that,
say, "childhood friend."</font>

109
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can we really meet him
in a place like this?</font>

110
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:16,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This lake holds fond memories
for Lord Sagi.</font>

111
00:06:16,980 --> 00:06:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... for me as well.</font>

112
00:06:22,860 --> 00:06:24,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In our young days,</font>

113
00:06:24,190 --> 00:06:28,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi always played with
his little sister Lady Toki here.</font>

114
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:39,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He might come around here today
with his attendants...</font>

115
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we're lucky.</font>

116
00:06:41,790 --> 00:06:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's up to luck, huh?</font>

117
00:06:54,890 --> 00:06:55,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Lord Sagi.</font>

118
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi, we have arrived.</font>

119
00:07:25,710 --> 00:07:26,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

120
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:31,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, wow...
So that's Lord Sagi, huh?</font>

121
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:34,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's cute. He is kind of my liking...</font>

122
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:57,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My watch has remained stopped
since that time.</font>

123
00:07:58,370 --> 00:08:01,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what's he doing?</font>

124
00:08:01,790 --> 00:08:04,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's probably reminiscing.</font>

125
00:08:08,210 --> 00:08:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only thing that can comfort
Lord Sagi's heart</font>

126
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:14,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is his memories with Lady Toki.</font>

127
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:23,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan.</font>

128
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:26,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is it?</font>

129
00:08:27,270 --> 00:08:29,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's this bloodthirsty aura
coming from?</font>

130
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:31,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not above ground?</font>

131
00:08:36,370 --> 00:08:38,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be, underwater...?</font>

132
00:08:43,410 --> 00:08:45,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Assassins! Protect Lord Sagi!</font>

133
00:08:52,050 --> 00:08:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think so!</font>

134
00:09:07,230 --> 00:09:10,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the heck are you guys?</font>

135
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:17,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!
I won't let you get away.</font>

136
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Naruto!</font>

137
00:09:21,830 --> 00:09:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

138
00:09:27,420 --> 00:09:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A letter bomb in the water.</font>

139
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a close one.</font>

140
00:09:40,810 --> 00:09:43,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you'd chased after them as is,
you would've been totally entangled.</font>

141
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Settle down.</font>

142
00:09:50,060 --> 00:09:50,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi!</font>

143
00:09:52,570 --> 00:09:53,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right?!</font>

144
00:09:53,690 --> 00:09:55,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I'm fine.</font>

145
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank goodness!</font>

146
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:03,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi, these three are ninja
from the Village Hidden in Leaves.</font>

147
00:10:03,950 --> 00:10:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They came to investigate
the true identity of the Cursed Warrior.</font>

148
00:10:07,870 --> 00:10:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was unnecessary.
I bet it was that Moso's idea?</font>

149
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was all because
he was worried for your life, Lord Sagi.</font>

150
00:10:17,170 --> 00:10:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact is, if these people
were not here now...</font>

151
00:10:20,090 --> 00:10:21,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Silence.</font>

152
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, my lord.</font>

153
00:10:22,890 --> 00:10:27,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, do you really not get
how this guy feels?!</font>

154
00:10:28,190 --> 00:10:30,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chishima was seriously
worried about you.</font>

155
00:10:30,980 --> 00:10:33,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without his passionate friendship,</font>

156
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:36,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Hidden Leaf Village wouldn't have
taken action with that low commission fee.</font>

157
00:10:37,190 --> 00:10:38,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am not obliged.</font>

158
00:10:39,820 --> 00:10:41,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How bothersome!</font>

159
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?!</font>

160
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:45,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Friendship is in the past.</font>

161
00:10:45,950 --> 00:10:50,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I became a feudal lord and
he is a mere page.</font>

162
00:10:51,580 --> 00:10:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are now standing on
different surfaces.</font>

163
00:10:55,300 --> 00:11:00,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say that again! I'll slug the guy
who tramples on friendship...!</font>

164
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let it go, Naruto.</font>

165
00:11:01,550 --> 00:11:03,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?! Let go of me!</font>

166
00:11:04,310 --> 00:11:06,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to give guys like this
a good thumping!</font>

167
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:08,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are talking about a feudal lord!</font>

168
00:11:11,850 --> 00:11:15,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would have been better
had it pierced my throat.</font>

169
00:11:19,990 --> 00:11:20,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go.
Yes, my lord.</font>

170
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:33,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, who does he think he is?!</font>

171
00:11:33,330 --> 00:11:35,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, a feudal lord.</font>

172
00:11:35,710 --> 00:11:37,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive him.</font>

173
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You don't have a problem
with being told off like that?!</font>

174
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wasn't like that in the old days.</font>

175
00:11:44,930 --> 00:11:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His father and little sister
died in succession</font>

176
00:11:48,430 --> 00:11:50,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he became cold-hearted.</font>

177
00:11:52,770 --> 00:11:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's what it was.</font>

178
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:56,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure the day will come</font>

179
00:11:56,270 --> 00:11:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when he will turn back into
the kind-hearted Lord Sagi.</font>

180
00:11:58,780 --> 00:12:00,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know about that.</font>

181
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Shuriken from before.</font>

182
00:12:04,370 --> 00:12:06,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is an odd shape.</font>

183
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:07,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me have a look.</font>

184
00:12:09,580 --> 00:12:11,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does it look familiar to you
or something?</font>

185
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. There are no ninja
in the Land of Birds.</font>

186
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:18,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there are guardsmen
receiving special training.</font>

187
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:21,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it a weapon those people use?</font>

188
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:22,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

189
00:12:22,590 --> 00:12:24,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who commands those guardsmen?</font>

190
00:12:24,970 --> 00:12:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person who organizes them
is Lord Komei the tactician.</font>

191
00:12:28,890 --> 00:12:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?!</font>

192
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Komei again.</font>

193
00:12:47,370 --> 00:12:51,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Komei must have originally thought to
mislead the public with the Cursed Warrior</font>

194
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attempted to create
a rift between Lord Sagi and Moso.</font>

195
00:12:55,830 --> 00:12:57,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the relationship between
the two is tight.</font>

196
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:01,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And by Moso summoning us here,
he probably sensed that the day</font>

197
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:04,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was approaching when the truth
behind the incident would be revealed</font>

198
00:13:04,630 --> 00:13:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he plotted
to assassinate Lord Sagi.</font>

199
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:11,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we've figured out that much,
let's charge on in...!</font>

200
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:14,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold your horses, Naruto.</font>

201
00:13:14,980 --> 00:13:17,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to find more hard evidence.</font>

202
00:13:18,110 --> 00:13:19,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, is that how it is?</font>

203
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, that's how it is.</font>

204
00:13:23,740 --> 00:13:25,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, look at that.</font>

205
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:37,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No doubt, it's Komei!</font>

206
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:40,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he'd go out without attendants</font>

207
00:13:40,380 --> 00:13:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though the Cursed Warrior
might appear.</font>

208
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, let's follow him.</font>

209
00:14:08,530 --> 00:14:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the temple where
the Cursed Warrior appeared last night.</font>

210
00:14:11,660 --> 00:14:13,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something smells fishy.</font>

211
00:14:38,690 --> 00:14:40,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's shown up...!</font>

212
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:52,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan.</font>

213
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:58,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?!</font>

214
00:14:58,210 --> 00:15:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to waver anymore!</font>

215
00:15:01,250 --> 00:15:02,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait.</font>

216
00:15:05,590 --> 00:15:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've witnessed the true identity
of the ghost!</font>

217
00:15:09,050 --> 00:15:10,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's there?</font>

218
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:13,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, Komei!</font>

219
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:17,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the one responsible
for controlling the Cursed Warrior, right?</font>

220
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:19,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

221
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:32,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

222
00:15:34,830 --> 00:15:36,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, get down!</font>

223
00:15:48,710 --> 00:15:49,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it!</font>

224
00:15:55,010 --> 00:15:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! No good.</font>

225
00:15:58,060 --> 00:16:00,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This thing's not just a ghost, after all.</font>

226
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A tornado?</font>

227
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:25,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't see the Cursed Warrior!</font>

228
00:16:31,050 --> 00:16:31,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan.</font>

229
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shuriken Shadow Clone?!</font>

230
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:47,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Trigrams Palm Rotation!</font>

231
00:16:54,490 --> 00:16:55,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you letting your mind drift for?!</font>

232
00:16:55,740 --> 00:16:59,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry... I never thought a ghost could
use ninjutsu.</font>

233
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a ghost inside the armor.
It's a Shinobi.</font>

234
00:17:04,790 --> 00:17:06,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And quite a wily one at that.</font>

235
00:17:08,380 --> 00:17:10,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the same shape
as the shuriken from this afternoon.</font>

236
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:17,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's an important witness.
Take him alive.</font>

237
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:19,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

238
00:17:28,110 --> 00:17:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we can't take him alive</font>

239
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:32,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we don't do something about
that tornado.</font>

240
00:17:32,150 --> 00:17:32,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

241
00:17:39,660 --> 00:17:40,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you!</font>

242
00:17:40,660 --> 00:17:42,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. I'll try!</font>

243
00:17:44,370 --> 00:17:48,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten, use as many weapons
as possible and draw his attention.</font>

244
00:17:48,670 --> 00:17:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roger.</font>

245
00:18:01,260 --> 00:18:03,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good. No effect at all.</font>

246
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:05,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's fine. Just keep at it.</font>

247
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:25,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji... now!</font>

248
00:18:32,290 --> 00:18:34,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist Technique,
8 Trigrams 64 Palms.</font>

249
00:18:36,880 --> 00:18:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Trigrams 2 Palms.</font>

250
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:40,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">4 Palms.
8 Palms.</font>

251
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">16 Palms.</font>

252
00:18:43,970 --> 00:18:45,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">32 Palms.</font>

253
00:18:46,930 --> 00:18:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">64 Palms.</font>

254
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:56,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, we did it!</font>

255
00:18:56,780 --> 00:18:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll find out the true identity
for sure this time.</font>

256
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:06,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show us your real face.</font>

257
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

258
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:30,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's empty again.</font>

259
00:19:31,100 --> 00:19:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This can't be!</font>

260
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:48,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Komei, we have seized from
a storeroom in your residence</font>

261
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:51,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one suit of white armor along
with guardsmen shuriken.</font>

262
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:57,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We would like you to report
to the magistrate's office</font>

263
00:19:57,380 --> 00:19:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as a material witness in
the recent Cursed Warrior incident</font>

264
00:19:59,920 --> 00:20:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as well as the attempted assassination
of Lord Sagi.</font>

265
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:08,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no choice.</font>

266
00:20:22,990 --> 00:20:24,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you very much.</font>

267
00:20:24,910 --> 00:20:28,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, Lord Sagi's heart should
settle down somewhat.</font>

268
00:20:28,990 --> 00:20:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Case closed.</font>

269
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still, they were sure prepared.</font>

270
00:20:34,580 --> 00:20:38,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here an hour has barely passed
since contacting Moso.</font>

271
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:39,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time...</font>

272
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was a human presence
in tonight's Cursed Warrior.</font>

273
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:47,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The presence of someone alive.</font>

274
00:20:48,930 --> 00:20:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A presence?</font>

275
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you said you didn't feel such
a presence in the first Cursed Warrior.</font>

276
00:20:55,230 --> 00:20:56,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

277
00:20:57,560 --> 00:21:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what does that mean?</font>

278
00:21:01,650 --> 00:21:05,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, the two Cursed Warrior
are separate beings.</font>

279
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

280
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

281
00:21:30,520 --> 00:21:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

282
00:21:30,520 --> 00:21:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

283
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:53,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

284
00:21:42,120 --> 00:21:53,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

285
00:21:52,910 --> 00:22:05,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

286
00:21:52,910 --> 00:22:05,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

287
00:22:05,250 --> 00:22:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

288
00:22:05,250 --> 00:22:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

289
00:22:16,770 --> 00:22:28,340
